    "mappingNote": "These are live machine signals of the OPC UA CNC companion specification (status, cycle, spindle, axes, tool, coolant, energy, vibration). B2MML Equipment has no named field for them; a value would only sit in a generic EquipmentProperty. Audit M3 (core 6.0.0): the setpoints and planned values (Set_Speed_Spindle, Set_Rate_Feed, Set_Pos_AxisX, Set_Pos_AxisY, Set_Pos_AxisZ, Plan_Time_Cycle) are equipment properties of the machine (Equipment.EquipmentProperty, named by their ID); the live Level-2 signals stay outside ISA-95.",
    "propertyMap": {
      "Set_Speed_Spindle": "Equipment.EquipmentProperty[ID=Set_Speed_Spindle].Value.ValueString",
      "Set_Rate_Feed": "Equipment.EquipmentProperty[ID=Set_Rate_Feed].Value.ValueString",
      "Set_Pos_AxisX": "Equipment.EquipmentProperty[ID=Set_Pos_AxisX].Value.ValueString",
      "Set_Pos_AxisY": "Equipment.EquipmentProperty[ID=Set_Pos_AxisY].Value.ValueString",
      "Set_Pos_AxisZ": "Equipment.EquipmentProperty[ID=Set_Pos_AxisZ].Value.ValueString",
      "Plan_Time_Cycle": "Equipment.EquipmentProperty[ID=Plan_Time_Cycle].Value.ValueString"
    }
  },
